cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata. If you build on the interaction ideas, also cite Spaceship IDE (https://github.com/chuanqisun/spaceship)."
type: software
title: "Heedle"
abstract: >-
  The layer where a person steers a small model's change by hand, inside bounds that are checked: knobs marked in
  units of behaviour, named changes with a share, pinned inputs, a commit through a gate on the weights and a claim
  one input can refute, and a hash-chained record that replays without the instrument.
authors:
  - name: "Moissanite Labs and the Heedle contributors"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Moissanite-Labs/heedle"
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - human-computer interaction
  - steerable models
  - verification
  - AI safety
